            <span>Calculate WPB elbow weight by NPS and schedule</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/astm-standards-pipe-fittings-flanges/" class="related-card">
            <strong>ASTM Standards Explained</strong>
            <span>Complete guide to A105, A182, A234, A403, A815</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/how-to-choose-flange-class/" class="related-card">
            <strong>How to Choose Flange Class</strong>
            <span>150 vs 300 vs 600 selection guide</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
